g": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "### Environment\r\n\r\n- WSL debian bookwarm\r\n- MAVSDK 2.12.12\r\n\r\n### Issues\r\n\r\nI want to use the \"log_capture\" feature, and found some problems. My log is created between arm and disarm.\r\n\r\n#### first log is good but after, not good\r\n\r\nAfter the my program is started, the first log file is good. But after the second log file shows, (PlotJuggler)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9beec947-2f34-4458-9df9-d81ecd4d0501)\r\nAnd in HEX editor shows like this,\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef5fc09f-9248-4da6-a27e-8041abbd0c14)\r\nuLog file's header is gone. Again, first ulog file is ok.\r\n\r\nSo, I tried different way like this.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n    if (_system)\r\n    {\r\n        if (enable) // start the log capture\r\n        {\r\n            _log_streaming       = std::make_shared<mavsdk::LogStreaming>(_system);\r\n            _h_log_streaming_raw = _log_streaming->subscribe_log_streaming_raw(\r\n                std::bind(&AutoPilot_Impl::onLogStreamingRaw, this, std::placeholders::_1));\r\n            _log_streaming->start_log_streaming();\r\n        }\r\n        else // stop\r\n        {\r\n            _log_streaming->stop_log_streaming();\r\n            _log_streaming->unsubscribe_log_streaming_raw(_h_log_streaming_raw);\r\n            _log_streaming.reset();\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn this case, second log file was good. ulog header is placed on start of file. But try to start the third log file, program is stuck like this.\r\n![\uc2a4\ud06c\ub9b0\uc0f7 2024-11-21 110451](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4526530-714f-48c0-85f8-830e3520761a)\r\n\r\n#### Am I did something wrong?\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2490305052", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448#issuecomment-2490305052", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448", "id": 2490305052, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6Ubwoc", "user": {"login": "ghost", "id": 10137, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost", "html_url": "https://github.com/ghost", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-11-21T07:54:00Z", "updated_at": "2024-11-21T07:54:00Z", "body": "Hi,\r\nI found some problems in second log file.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba2d8e28-5095-440e-925f-a2d35ef5ed9e)\r\n\r\nAfter the second log file, some garbage is added in top of new file's header.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2490305052/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2492353155", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448#issuecomment-2492353155", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448", "id": 2492353155, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6UjkqD", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-11-21T21:15:56Z", "updated_at": "2024-11-21T21:15:56Z", "body": "I'm using log streaming with this version and it works for me, so my hunch is that you write invalid data somewhere. Can you share more of the code?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2492353155/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2492610249", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448#issuecomment-2492610249", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2448", "id": 2492610249, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6UkjbJ", "user": {"login": "ghost", "id": 10137, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost", "html_url": "https://github.com/ghost", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-11-22T00:14:14Z", "updated_at": "2024-11-22T00:24:56Z", "body": "When mavlink is connected\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n    _h_log_streaming_raw = _log_streaming->subscribe_log_streaming_raw(\r\n        std::bind(&AutoPilot_Impl::onLogStreamingRaw, this, std::placeholders::_1));\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd, callback is\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid AutoPilot_Impl::onLogStreamingRaw(mavsdk::LogStreaming::LogStreamingRaw log_raw)\r\n{\r\n    if (sigLogStreamingUpdated.num_slots() > 0)\r\n    {\r\n        auto log = mavsdk::base64_decode(log_raw.data);\r\n        sigLogStreamingUpdated(log);\r\n        // sigLogStreamingUpdated(log_raw.data);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nLog streaming start/stop\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid AutoPilot_Impl::SetLogCapture(bool enable)\r\n{\r\n    if (_log_streaming)\r\n    {\r\n        if (enable)\r\n            _log_streaming->start_log_streaming();\r\n        else\r\n            _log_streaming->stop_log_streaming();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore the log capture module is started,\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n    // register callback\r\n    _config.autopilot_->SigLogStreamingUpdatedHandle().connect(\r\n        boost::bind(&LogCapture_Impl::slotAutoPilotLogStreamingUpdated, this, boost::placeholders::_1));\r\n```\r\n\r\nCallback handler and circular buffer\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n// in header file\r\n    boost::circular_buffer<std::vector<uint8_t>> _ring_buffer { 10 };\r\n\r\n// and callback handler\r\nvoid LogCapture_Impl::slotAutoPilotArmedUpdated(bool armed)\r\n{\r\n    _start_logging = armed;\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid LogCapture_Impl::slotAutoPilotLogStreamingUpdated(std::vector<uint8_t>& log)\r\n{\r\n    std::lock_guard<std::mutex> locker(_ring_buffer_lock);\r\n    _ring_buffer.push_back(log);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere is log to file\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid LogCapture_Impl::run()\r\n{\r\n    bool          logging { false };\r\n    std::ofstream log_file;\r\n    std::vector<uint8_t> log_row;\r\n\r\n    // for stabilization delay\r\n    std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::milliseconds(500));\r\n\r\n    try\r\n    {\r\n        if (not std::filesystem::is_directory(_config.file_path_))\r\n            std::filesystem::create_directories(_config.file_path_);\r\n    }\r\n    catch (std::exception& e)\r\n    {\r\n#ifndef NDEBUG\r\n        std::cerr << e.what() << std::endl;\r\n#endif\r\n        _config.file_path_ = DEFAULT_LOGDIR;\r\n        std::filesystem::create_directories(std::filesystem::path(_config.file_path_));\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    while (not _run_thread->interruption_requested())\r\n    {\r\n        if (logging != _start_logging)\r\n        {\r\n            logging = _start_logging;\r\n\r\n            if (logging)\r\n            {\r\n                std::string file_path { _config.file_path_ + \"/\" + createFileName() };\r\n                log_file.open(file_path, std::ios::binary);\r\n                _config.autopilot_->SetLogCapture(true);\r\n            }\r\n            else\r\n            {\r\n                if (log_file.is_open())\r\n                {\r\n                    _config.autopilot_->SetLogCapture(false);\r\n                    log_file.close();\r\n                }\r\n                _ring_buffer.clear();\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        if (log_file.is_open() and (not _ring_buffer.empty()))\r\n        {\r\n            {\r\n                std::lock_guard<std::mutex> locker(_ring_buffer_lock);\r\n                log_row = _ring_buffer.front();\r\n                _ring_buffer.pop_front();\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            log_file.write(reinterpret_cast<char*>(log_row.data()), log_row.size());\r\n        }\r\n        else\r\n        {\r\n            std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::milliseconds(2));\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2492610249/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "con